      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TAMARAMA BEACH (4) gave a start after copping a check in running and missed the frame when a 9 length fifth (25.66) at Gunnedah in a Grade 5. Well worth another try. MEDIA MAGNATE (1) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when sixth at this track over 318m behind Valentino Beach (19.26) in a Mix 3/4. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. EAR MUFFS (7) doesn't have the best strike-rate. Hit the board with a minor placing last time when third (23.85) at this track. Has never been out of the placings from two starts out of this box. Bold showing expected. TIMBER JACK (6) can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
